a(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">At\u00e9 10 de Outubro:<\/strong> 15.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (10\/10\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">De 11 a 18 de Outubro:<\/strong> 17.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (18\/10\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Trail Running<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Mini Trail<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 25 Out \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:15<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">At\u00e9 10 de Outubro:<\/strong> 10.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (10\/10\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">De 11 a 18 de Outubro:<\/strong> 12.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (18\/10\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Caminhada<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 25 Out \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:15<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">At\u00e9 10 de Outubro:<\/strong> 10.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (10\/10\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">De 11 a 18 de Outubro:<\/strong> 12.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (18\/10\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a data e o local de concentra\u00e7\u00e3o do Trail P\u00e9 do Negro 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A 7\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o realiza-se no domingo, 25 de outubro de 2026, na Avenida de Nosso Senhor do Socorro, em Labruja, concelho de Ponte de Lima (GPS: 41.841799, -8.593844).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e os hor\u00e1rios das partidas?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O Trail Longo (30 km) arranca \u00e0s 08:45, seguido pelo Trail Curto (18 km) \u00e0s 09:00 e pelo Mini Trail (10 km) e Caminhada (10 km) em conjunto \u00e0s 09:15.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e pre\u00e7os?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">At\u00e9 10 de outubro os valores s\u00e3o 22 \u20ac (Trail Longo), 15 \u20ac (Trail Curto) e 10 \u20ac (Mini Trail e Caminhada). De 11 a 18 de outubro os pre\u00e7os passam para 25 \u20ac, 17 \u20ac e 12 \u20ac, respetivamente.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O que inclui a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o no evento?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o contempla dorsal personalizado com chip para as provas competitivas, seguro de acidentes pessoais, abastecimentos s\u00f3lidos e l\u00edquidos, lembran\u00e7a finisher na chegada e banhos quentes.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde e quando \u00e9 feito o levantamento dos dorsais?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O secretariado funciona no local de partida a 24 de outubro (14:00 \u00e0s 18:00) e no pr\u00f3prio dia da prova, 25 de outubro, entre as 07:15 e as 08:15.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Trail P\u00e9 do Negro 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-10-25\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Avenida de Nosso Senhor do Socorro, Labruja, Ponte de Lima\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Ponte de Lima\", \"addressRegion\": \"Viana do Castelo\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"EDL Trail e Munic\u00edpio de Ponte de Lima\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 a data e o local de concentra\u00e7\u00e3o do Trail P\u00e9 do Negro 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A 7\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o realiza-se no domingo, 25 de outubro de 2026, na Avenida de Nosso Senhor do Socorro, em Labruja, concelho de Ponte de Lima (GPS: 41.841799, -8.593844).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e os hor\u00e1rios das partidas?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O Trail Longo (30 km) arranca \u00e0s 08:45, seguido pelo Trail Curto (18 km) \u00e0s 09:00 e pelo Mini Trail (10 km) e Caminhada (10 km) em conjunto \u00e0s 09:15.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e pre\u00e7os?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"At\u00e9 10 de outubro os valores s\u00e3o 22 \u20ac (Trail Longo), 15 \u20ac (Trail Curto) e 10 \u20ac (Mini Trail e Caminhada). De 11 a 18 de outubro os pre\u00e7os passam para 25 \u20ac, 17 \u20ac e 12 \u20ac, respetivamente.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"O que inclui a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o no evento?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o contempla dorsal personalizado com chip para as provas competitivas, seguro de acidentes pessoais, abastecimentos s\u00f3lidos e l\u00edquidos, lembran\u00e7a finisher na chegada e banhos quentes.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde e quando \u00e9 feito o levantamento dos dorsais?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O secretariado funciona no local de partida a 24 de outubro (14:00 \u00e0s 18:00) e no pr\u00f3prio dia da prova, 25 de outubro, entre as 07:15 e as 08:15.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":68608,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,22,497,498],"event_type_2":[726,820,62],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[